# LingXiAgent Multi-Tiered Licensing Architecture
# 灵犀多轨分层许可体系

Copyright (c) 2026 LingXiFox (https://github.com/LingXiFox). All rights reserved.

本项目采用**多轨分层许可体系（Multi-Tiered Licensing Scheme）**：针对底座核心（Core）与上层表现客户端（Frontend）实施差异化授权策略。在保障个人开发者本地探索自由与前端生态开放的同时，保护底层核心知识产权。

---

## 🧭 模块与授权范围矩阵 (License Scope Matrix)

| 目录与组件 (Directories & Components) | 适用许可协议 (License) | 本地构建/自用 (Local Personal Use) | 公开二次分发/上架 (Redistribution & Re-hosting) | 商业营利使用 (Commercial Exploitation) |
| :--- | :--- | :---: | :---: | :---: |
| **Core & Infrastructure 底座与核心**<br/>• `Sources/LingXiCore`<br/>• `Sources/LingXiRuntime`<br/>• `Sources/LingXiPlatform`<br/>• `Sources/LingXiProtocol`<br/>• `Sources/LingXiStorage`<br/>• `Sources/LingXiAppCommon`<br/>• 底座总线及底层核心脚本 | **LingXi Core Source-Available License 1.0 (LCSAL-1.0)**<br/>*(源码可用 · 个人自用 · 禁分发 · 禁商用)* | ✅ **允许**<br/>(可免费下载、本地编译并自用体验) | ❌ **严禁**<br/>(严禁二次上架GitHub、分发副本或制作镜像) | ❌ **严禁**<br/>(严禁商业化、收费代理或SaaS托管) |
| **Frontend & Clients 表现层与客户端**<br/>• `Sources/LingXiTUI`<br/>• `Sources/LingXiCLI` (表现层接入)<br/>• 未来的 `LingXiGUI` / `LingXiWebUI`<br/>• 前端交互、渲染器适配及主题配置 | **PolyForm Noncommercial License 1.0.0**<br/>*(源码开放 · 允许自由分发 · 严禁商用)* | ✅ **允许** | ✅ **允许**<br/>(可自由二次托管、分发与传播，须附带非商用许可) | ❌ **严禁**<br/>(严禁用于任何营利或收费商业服务) |
| **Third-Party Vendors 第三方依赖**<br/>• `Vendor/OpenTUI/` | 各自独立开源协议 (GPLv3 / Ghostty / MIT 等) | 遵照原上游许可 | 遵照原上游许可 | 遵照原上游许可 |

---

## Part 1: LingXi Core Source-Available License 1.0 (LCSAL-1.0)

**Applicable Scope**: `Sources/LingXiCore`, `Sources/LingXiRuntime`, `Sources/LingXiPlatform`, `Sources/LingXiProtocol`, `Sources/LingXiStorage`, `Sources/LingXiAppCommon`, and associated core infrastructure.

### 中文法律条款声明

1. **授权范围 (Grant of Rights)**：
   版权所有者（LingXiFox）特此授予任何合法获取本核心源码的个人非独占、不可转让、不可转授权的权利，仅限于在个人受控的本地计算环境中进行**阅读、学习、研究、本地编译及个人单机非商业运行**（“本地自用”）。
2. **严禁二次上架与再分发 (Strict Prohibition on Redistribution & Re-Hosting)**：
   **严禁**任何实体或个人将本核心源码、修改衍生版本、编译产物（包括静态库、动态库、可执行文件）以任何形式公开分发、镜像托管、重新上传或二次上架至包括但不限于 **GitHub、GitLab、Gitee、Bitbucket、云盘、包管理镜像源（Swift Package Index、Homebrew、APT 等）** 或任何公共/私有分发网络。
3. **严禁商业化使用 (Strict Prohibition on Commercial Use)**：
   **严禁**将本核心用于任何直接或间接的营利性活动、商业运营、企业生产环境部署、付费技术支持、收费 API / Token 代理中继，亦不得作为 SaaS、PaaS、云服务或外包交付产品的底层组件。
4. **贡献与合并规范 (Contributing & Collaboration)**：
   若您对 Core 有改进或缺陷修复意向，必须直接向官方主仓库（https://github.com/LingXiFox/LingXiAgent）发起 Pull Request。PR 的提交即代表您同意将贡献代码遵循本项目许可体系，且所有 PR 必须经由版权所有者（@LingXiFox）亲笔审查核准后方可合并。未经核准的任何分支合并或外部分发均属侵权。
5. **免责声明 (Disclaimer of Warranty)**：
   本核心源码按“原样（AS IS）”提供，不提供任何明示或暗示的保证，包括但不限于适销性、特定用途适用性及不侵权保证。在任何情况下，作者均不对因使用本软件引起的任何索赔、损害或其他责任承担法律责任。

### English Legal Text

1. **Grant of Rights**: 
   The Copyright Holder (LingXiFox) hereby grants to any individual obtaining a copy of the Core source code a non-exclusive, non-transferable, non-sublicensable right to inspect, study, locally compile, and execute the software solely within their private, personal computing environment for personal and non-commercial evaluation ("Personal Local Use").
2. **Prohibition on Redistribution and Re-Hosting**:
   You may **NOT** redistribute, republish, mirror, sublicense, package, or host the Core source code, any derived works, or compiled binaries on any public or private network or code hosting platform, including but not limited to **GitHub, GitLab, Gitee, Bitbucket, package registries (Swift Package Index, Homebrew, APT), or CDN mirrors**.
3. **Prohibition on Commercial Exploitation**:
   You may **NOT** use the Core software, in whole or in part, for any commercial purpose, monetary gain, enterprise production deployment, paid API proxying/relaying, or as part of any SaaS, PaaS, or cloud-hosted service offering.
4. **Patches and Contributions**:
   Any proposed enhancements or fixes must be contributed upstream via Pull Request to the official repository at https://github.com/LingXiFox/LingXiAgent. All contributions are subject to review and explicit approval by @LingXiFox.
5. **No Warranty**:
   THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE COPYRIGHT HOLDER BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES, OR OTHER LIABILITY.

